          "id": 3620331505,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "Is reassembly_table_init() sufficient?\n\nIf only checking for reassembly_table_register(), getting:\n\nError: epan/dissectors/packet-btbredr_rf.c l2cap_msg_reassembly_table not registered \n\nError: epan/dissectors/packet-cosem.c dlms_reassembly_table not registered \n\nError: epan/dissectors/packet-dvb-s2-bb.c dvb_s2_gse_reassembly_table not registered \n\nError: epan/dissectors/packet-isobus.c isobus_reassembly_table not registered \n\nError: epan/dissectors/packet-opa-mad.c opa_mad_rmpp_reassembly_table not registered \n\nError: epan/dissectors/packet-s7comm.c s7comm_reassembly_table not registered \n\nError: epan/dissectors/packet-someip.c someip_tp_reassembly_table not registered \n\nError: epan/dissectors/packet-wassp.c wassp_reassembled_table not registered",
